+         +makeSound()
+     class Dog {
+         +bark()
+ ### Dependency (`<..`)
+ One class depends on another, often as a parameter or local variable.
+     OrderProcessor <.. PaymentGateway
+ ### Realization/Implementation (`<|..`)
+ Class implements an interface.
+     class Drawable {
